  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating collaborations between small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in the Netherlands and Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar has recently opened for international trade and investments. Foreign companies and investors face many obstacles when entering the Myanmar market. Many untapped opportunities exist in the severely underdeveloped SME market. Opportunities for growth, partnerships or selling or buying of products to or from these SMEs should be identified to benefit both companies or investors in the Netherlands and the population of Myanmar.This research project aims to improve the partnerships between Dutch and Myanmarese partners and investments through1.	better understanding of needs, expectations, capacity and cultural habits,2.	practical implementation of existing research on the regulatory environment, and3.	developing a business accelerator program by Rockstart.</narrative>
  </description>
